al, you"},{"start":874,"text":"could say"},{"start":875,"text":"cool."},{"start":877,"text":"It's like adding a wool at the end."},{"start":880,"text":"cool"},{"start":884,"text":"It sounds more"},{"start":886,"text":"like a native would say cool."},{"start":890,"text":"But,"},{"start":891,"text":"I think that it doesn't matter."},{"start":894,"text":"I think an accent"},{"start":896,"text":"is what makes you unique"},{"start":899,"text":"and it's what connects you to your"},{"start":902,"text":"native language."},{"start":904,"text":"It doesn't matter if you have an accent."},{"start":908,"text":"Accents are beautiful in my opinion."},{"start":911,"text":"But, if you want to sound native, that's"},{"start":914,"text":"how you can say cool. Mhm."},{"start":919,"text":"All right, our last page."},{"start":922,"text":"As the sun"},{"start":924,"text":"started to set,"},{"start":928,"text":"I sat"},{"start":930,"text":"on a bench"},{"start":934,"text":"and thought about something."},{"start":947,"text":"Would I rather"},{"start":950,"text":"live"},{"start":951,"text":"in a place like this"},{"start":955,"text":"or"},{"start":957,"text":"leave"},{"start":959,"text":"and continue traveling?"},{"start":969,"text":"I wasn't sure,"},{"start":972,"text":"but I knew one thing."},{"start":976,"text":"This was a day I would remember"},{"start":982,"text":"for a very long time."},{"start":994,"text":"All right, we have actually three big"},{"start":997,"text":"ones here."},{"start":998,"text":"I wanted to mention one I didn't say."},{"start":1002,"text":"live"},{"start":1004,"text":"So, there's live"},{"start":1007,"text":"and live."},{"start":1009,"text":"The same spelling,"},{"start":1011,"text":"different pronunciation."},{"start":1013,"text":"live"},{"start":1015,"text":"I live in Mexico."},{"start":1020,"text":"live"},{"start":1022,"text":"I am going live"},{"start":1025,"text":"on YouTube."},{"start":1029,"text":"leave"},{"start":1031,"text":"I will leave tomorrow."},{"sta